# The homes an exception can have. The fixture holds Montréal signed out, one
# loan whose delivery failed, one borrow the library never confirmed, one hold
# it never confirmed either, and one return it did not answer.
clean
tap Settings
wait-for Connection
wait-for Sign-in needed
expect --auth montreal
tap Library
wait-for My books
wait-for Needs your attention
expect Uncertain fixture title
expect Check your library account
expect Uncertain fixture hold
expect BAnQ · Hold
clean
# A delivery failure belongs on its loan, so it is on BAnQ's shelf rather than
# in the section above.
tap BAnQ
wait-for Fixture unsent title
expect Not sent to your reader
clean
tap Fixture unsent title
wait-for Needs you
expect both safe on your home
expect status 1
expect Send to my reader again
clean
tap Send to my reader again
wait-for My books
clean
wait-for Sent to your reader
clean
# And an unconfirmed return is on the loan it belongs to, at the other library.
tap Montréal
wait-for Return not confirmed
clean
